name: Sprott Q
family: Flows
desc: One of J. C. Sprott's 19 simplest chaotic flows (case Q) — five terms, one or two nonlinearities.
ref: J. C. Sprott, "Some simple chaotic flows", Phys. Rev. E 50 (1994)
tags: flow, sprott, 3d
dt: 0.02
ic: 0.1 0.1 0.1
camera: 25 20 0 1

param a = 3.1 [2, 4]
param b = 0.5 [0.2, 1]

dx = -z
dy = x - y
dz = a*x + y^2 + b*z
